<main>
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>Zephyr stores the minimum data needed to operate: server settings you configure, saved game accounts you link (e.g. League of Legends), XP/level data, and message content only where a feature explicitly requires it (such as AI chat history for context).</p>
<p>Zephyr does not sell or share your data with third parties. Data tied to a server is removed when Zephyr is removed from that server, and you can request removal of your personal data at any time by contacting the bot owner.</p>
<p>This policy may be updated as features change.</p>
</main>
