<main>
<h1>Commands</h1>
<p class="lead">Zephyr responds to <code>!</code> commands, and every command below also has an Arabic-language alias built in. This page covers what the bot can actually do today, split into what's free for any server and what's unlocked with Premium.</p>

<div class="tier-grid">
  <div class="tier-card free">
    <span class="tag">Free</span>
    <h3>Included on every server</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Full moderation suite &mdash; jail/unjail, hardban list, auto-role, welcome messages, reaction roles, anti-spam, auto-mod logging, server backups</li>
      <li>Leveling &amp; XP with ranks and a leaderboard</li>
      <li>20+ reaction/fun commands, games (8-ball, coinflip, RPS, dice), polls, reminders</li>
      <li>Basic AI Q&amp;A (<code>!ask</code>, <code>!asksmart</code>)</li>
      <li>Economy basics &mdash; daily/weekly rewards, work, slots, blackjack</li>
      <li>Utility &mdash; server info, avatars, timezones, snipe, quotes, League of Legends lookup</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="tier-card premium">
    <span class="tag">Premium</span>
    <h3>Unlocked for upgraded servers</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Persistent AI conversations with memory (<code>!ai</code>) and AI image generation (<code>!imagine</code>)</li>
      <li>Full music player &mdash; queue, skip, pause/resume, now playing, from voice channels</li>
      <li>Full economy &amp; RPG system &mdash; shop, buying/selling, inventory, pet collecting, crafting, recipes, player trading</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>AI Assistant</h2>
  <p class="cat-desc">Two tiers of AI: quick one-off answers for free, full conversational memory and image generation on Premium.</p>

  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!ask &lt;question&gt;</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Asks the AI a single question and gets a one-off answer &mdash; no memory between messages.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!ask what's a good way to learn python?</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!asksmart &lt;question&gt;</span> <span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Same as <code>!ask</code> but routed to a stronger model for more complex questions. Aliases: <code>ask+</code>, <code>smart</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!asksmart explain how blockchains reach consensus</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!ai [description]</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Starts an ongoing AI chat in the channel that remembers context across messages, like a real conversation instead of one-shot replies.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!ai you're a sarcastic pirate assistant</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!imagine &lt;prompt&gt;</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Generates an AI image from a text prompt directly in Discord.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!imagine a dragon made of northern lights, digital art</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>Music</h2>
  <p class="cat-desc">Full voice-channel music playback &mdash; Premium only.</p>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!play &lt;song or URL&gt;</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Joins your voice channel and plays a song, or adds it to the queue if something's already playing.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!play interstellar main theme</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!queue &middot; !skip &middot; !pause &middot; !resume &middot; !stop &middot; !nowplaying &middot; !clearqueue</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Standard playback controls &mdash; view what's queued, skip the current track, pause/resume, stop entirely, see what's playing now, or wipe the whole queue.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!skip &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !queue &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !nowplaying</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>Economy &amp; RPG</h2>
  <p class="cat-desc">A full in-server currency (Zeni) and pet-collecting game. Earning is free for everyone; spending, crafting, and pet management are Premium.</p>

  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!daily &middot; !weekly &middot; !work</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Claim recurring currency rewards, or work a quick job for Zeni.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!daily</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!slots [bet] &middot; !blackjack [bet]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Gamble your Zeni on a slot machine, or play a full hand of blackjack (<code>!hit</code> / <code>!stand</code> to play it out).</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!slots 100</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!balance &middot; !richest</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Check your (or someone else's) Zeni balance, or see the server's richest-players leaderboard. Aliases: <code>bal</code>, <code>wallet</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!balance @friend</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!shop [category] &middot; !buy &middot; !sell &middot; !pay &lt;@user&gt; &lt;amount&gt;</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Browse the item/chest shop, buy or sell items, or pay another member directly.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!shop chests &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !buy chest_common &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !pay @friend 500</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!inventory &middot; !open &lt;chest&gt; &middot; !use &lt;item&gt;</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">View your bag, open a chest you bought, or use a consumable item. Alias: <code>inv</code>, <code>bag</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!inventory</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!pets &middot; !setpet &lt;#&gt; &middot; !renamepet &lt;#&gt; &lt;name&gt; &middot; !feed &lt;food&gt;</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Collect, equip, rename, and feed pets you've earned from chests.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!pets &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !setpet 2 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !renamepet 2 Sparky</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!recipes [search] &middot; !craft &lt;item&gt; &middot; !quests</span><span class="badge premium">Premium</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Look up crafting recipes, craft an item from materials, or check your active/weekly quests.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!craft health potion</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>Leveling &amp; Ranks</h2>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!rank [@member]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Shows your (or another member's) current level and XP progress.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!rank @friend</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!leaderboard</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Shows the server's top-ranked members by XP. Alias: <code>lb</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!leaderboard</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>Moderation &amp; Server Management</h2>
  <p class="cat-desc">A full moderation toolkit, free on every server.</p>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!jail &lt;@member&gt; &middot; !unjail &lt;@member&gt;</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Locks a member into a restricted "jail" role/channel, or releases them.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!jail @user spamming links</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!hardbanlist &middot; !unhardban &lt;user id&gt; &middot; !adduser &lt;user id&gt;</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Manage a persistent hard-ban list that re-bans evasion attempts.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!hardbanlist</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!autorole &lt;role&gt; &middot; !autoroleoff &middot; !statusrole &middot; !moverole</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Automatically assign a role to new members, or move/reorder role automation rules.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!autorole @Member</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!welcomesetup &middot; !welcometest</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Configure a welcome message for new members and preview it instantly.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!welcometest</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!reactionrole &middot; !addreaction</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Set up reaction-role messages so members can self-assign roles by reacting.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!reactionrole</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!antispam &middot; !automodlog &middot; !automodimmune &middot; !whitelistbot</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Configure anti-spam protection, set the auto-mod log channel, and exempt trusted members or bots from auto-moderation.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!antispam on</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!backup &middot; !statschannels</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Back up server configuration, or set up voice channels that live-update with server stats (member count, etc).</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!backup</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>Utility</h2>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!serverinfo</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Shows key stats about the current server &mdash; member count, creation date, boosts, and more.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!serverinfo</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!av [@member]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Shows a member's full-size avatar. Aliases: <code>avatar</code>, <code>pfp</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!av @friend</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!tz [action] [value]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Set your timezone and check what time it is for other members. Aliases: <code>timezone</code>, <code>worldclock</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!tz set America/New_York</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!snipe [count]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Shows the most recently deleted message(s) in the channel.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!snipe 3</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!poll &lt;question&gt; | option | option</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Creates a reaction-based poll for the server to vote on.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!poll best game? | Marvel Rivals | League of Legends</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!remind &lt;time&gt; &lt;reminder&gt;</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Sets a reminder that pings you back after the given time. Alias: <code>reminder</code>.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!remind 2h stretch and drink water</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!quote [args]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Saves or recalls a memorable quote from the server.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!quote add "never gonna give you up" - Rick</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!lol &lt;summoner&gt;</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Looks up a League of Legends player's rank and stats.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!lol Faker#KR1</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!riotkey [new key]</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Updates the Riot Games API key that powers <code>!lol</code>. Riot's free developer keys expire every 24 hours, so this key has to be refreshed daily: grab a fresh key from the <a href="https://developer.riotgames.com/" style="color:#d8c9ff;">Riot Developer Portal</a> (log in, click "Regenerate API Key" on your dashboard), then run this command with the new key to plug it into the bot.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!riotkey RGAPI-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cat">
  <h2>Fun &amp; Games</h2>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">!8ball &lt;question&gt; &middot; !coinflip &middot; !roll [sides] &middot; !rps &lt;choice&gt;</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Classic quick games &mdash; a magic 8-ball, a coin flip, dice rolls, and rock-paper-scissors against the bot.</p>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!8ball will it rain tomorrow? &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !roll 20 &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; !rps rock</span>
  </div>
  <div class="cmd">
    <div class="cmd-top"><span class="cmd-name">Reaction GIFs &middot; !kiss / !hug / !slap @member ...</span><span class="badge free">Free</span></div>
    <p class="cmd-desc">Over 20 anime-style reaction commands, each posting a matching GIF and mentioning the target member.</p>
    <div class="reaction-list">
      <span>kiss</span><span>hug</span><span>pat</span><span>slap</span><span>poke</span><span>cuddle</span><span>wave</span><span>bite</span><span>punch</span><span>highfive</span><span>wink</span><span>yeet</span><span>dance</span><span>cry</span><span>blush</span><span>laugh</span><span>smile</span><span>thumbsup</span>
    </div>
    <span class="cmd-ex">!hug @friend</span>
  </div>
</div>

